<title>USA: FGIC qualifies two issues for bond insurance.</title>
<headline>FGIC qualifies two issues for bond insurance.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Financial Guaranty Insurance Co said Monday it qualified for bond insurance the following two municipal issues scheduled for competitive sale today:</p>
<p>--Forest Park School District, Mich., $7.13 million school bonds.</p>
<p>--Mansfield, Texas, $6 million General Obligations.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
